  "title": "三十分有型",
  "summary": "三十分有型 與音響公司夥伴去大全聯吃飯，對面有三十分有型理髮店，十分裡面三十分。 從電扶梯下樓後，眼角瞄到類似 帥熊 的身影。 疑似帥熊？ 結果是美兔。 在原地哭哭的美兔 離開時已經沒看到，希望是原主人把她帶回家了。",
  "content": "<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/300-percent-stylish.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/300-percent-stylish.jpg\" alt=\"三十分有型\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n    <span>\n      三十分有型\n    </span>\n  \n</div></p>\n<p>與音響公司夥伴去大全聯吃飯，對面有三十分有型理髮店，十分裡面三十分。</p>\n<p>從電扶梯下樓後，眼角瞄到類似<a href=\"https://yangbear.bearblog.dev/about-me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">帥熊</a>的身影。</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/beauty-rabbit.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/beauty-rabbit.jpg\" alt=\"疑似帥熊？\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n    <span>\n      疑似帥熊？\n    </span>\n  \n</div></p>\n<p>結果是美兔。</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/beauty-rabbit2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/musings/300-percent-stylish/beauty-rabbit2.jpg\" alt=\"在原地哭哭的美兔\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n    <span>\n      在原地哭哭的美兔\n    </span>\n  \n</div></p>\n<p>離開時已經沒看到，希望是原主人把她帶回家了。</p>",
